{:paths ["src"]
 ;; Deliberately dependency-free, for the same reason `kotoba-lang/taxlaw` and
 ;; `kotoba-lang/worklaw` are: something that needs to know whether a tax
 ;; authority may take an examination step should not thereby acquire a
 ;; ledger, a case-management system, or a network client.
 ;;
 ;; It also must not acquire `kotoba-lang/iso3166`. `world-coverage` requires a
 ;; universe and has no default — see the README. A library that shipped its own
 ;; denominator would be answering the one question the caller has to ask.
 :deps {
        io.github.kotoba-lang/test {:local/root "../kotoba.test"}}
 :aliases
 {:test {:extra-paths ["test"]}}}
